@startuml state-guest-visit
' Title: SM-02 Guest visit lifecycle (PlantUML version of state-guest-visit.mmd, keep both in sync)
' Source: enums/GuestVisitStatus.java, service/GuestVisitService.java (create, review, cancel, revoke,
'   closeForAreaDeactivation), service/GuestVisitJobService.java, scheduler/GuestVisitScheduler.java · Generated from main @ e474968
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam roundCorner 6
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam nodesep 65
skinparam ranksep 45
skinparam stateStartColor #000000
skinparam stateEndColor #000000
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam stateBorderColor #475569
skinparam stateFontColor #0F172A
skinparam stateArrowColor #2563EB
hide empty description

title SM-02 Guest Visit Lifecycle

state PENDING : awaiting review
state APPROVED : guests may enter inside the window
state REJECTED
state CANCELLED
state REVOKED
state EXPIRED
state COMPLETED

[*] --> PENDING : Host (Authorized User or Facility Manager)\ncreates visit [host eligible, Confidential areas,\nhost covers the areas for the whole window]

PENDING --> APPROVED : Facility Manager approves\n[version matches, reviewer is not host,\nnow < startTime, rules re-checked]
PENDING --> REJECTED : Facility Manager rejects\n[version matches, reviewer is not host,\nnow < startTime, reason]
PENDING --> CANCELLED : Host cancels\n[version matches, now < endTime]
PENDING --> CANCELLED : Administrator deactivates an area\nof the visit [now < endTime]
PENDING --> EXPIRED : System job every minute\n[now >= startTime]

APPROVED --> CANCELLED : Host cancels\n[version matches, now < endTime]\n/ biometrics deleted
APPROVED --> REVOKED : Facility Manager revokes\n[version matches, reviewer is not host,\nreason, now < endTime] / biometrics deleted
APPROVED --> REVOKED : Administrator deactivates an area\nof the visit [now < endTime] / biometrics deleted
APPROVED --> COMPLETED : System job every minute\n[now >= endTime]

REJECTED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
REVOKED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]
COMPLETED --> [*]

note right of APPROVED
  Biometric deletion is not a visit state.
  It is Guest.biometricStatus (GuestBiometricStatus):
  NO_PHOTO -> PHOTO_READY after the Administrator
  attaches a photo with recorded consent;
  DELETED on cancel or revoke of an APPROVED visit,
  on expiry, or by job at endTime + GUEST_FACE_RETENTION_HOURS.
  PHOTO_ONLY exists in the enum but no code sets it.
end note
@enduml
